claims:
9. A system comprising:
a plurality of host machines;
a storage pool including local storage devices of the plurality of host machines;
a virtual file server comprising a plurality of file server virtual machines (FSVMs), each of the plurality of host machines configured to host at least one of the plurality of FSVMs, wherein each of the plurality of FSVMs is configured to present a namespace of storage items;
wherein the virtual file server is configured to:
protect an individual share of the virtualized file server at least in part by adding a volume group used for file services storage to a protection domain, wherein each of the FSVMs presenting the namespace of storage items, including the individual share; and
replicate the share at least in part to update a remote site for disaster recovery of at least a portion of the virtualized file server.
